+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Reuse up to eight idle account-sidecar WAL connections while preserving file-family admission, FULL synchronization and SQLite's default automatic checkpoint. Keep read snapshots separate, invalidate changed or failed connections, and hold ownership until every connection is closed. Unrecoverable connection cleanup requires a daemon restart instead of admitting another writer.
